"Personal Home Use" means use by a natural person and members of that person's
household, on devices they own or control, solely for private, non-commercial
household purposes. Operating a business from home is not Personal Home Use
when the Software supports that business.

"Commercial Use" includes use in a trade, profession or business; internal
business operations; paid installation, hosting, support or managed services;
use for customers; commercial rental accommodation; resale; and incorporation
in a product or service offered for payment or commercial advantage. Charging
separately for the Software is not required for use to be commercial.

